{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"1f1758dbaef5d2281cb2f5901e945f693e70d7c7a98942e687bef2ed263120cb","ja":"―これは少女たちが夢の扉を見つける、少し前の物語―","zh":"——这是少女们在寻获梦想之门前不久的故事——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b8d734b3af49a0988a6bf1e9cdb069af83e86eb545a420cb14aac2a63240a737","ja":"……の、少し後の物語","zh":"……稍后发生的故事","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8b36e3ae1157e28d37956a612fc9d5e02f1bf2a925cbef917c7d6c7f0a724870","ja":"はろはろー♪\nあれ？　兄ちゃんと新人兄ちゃんは？","zh":"哈啰哈啰～♪\n咦？哥哥和新人哥哥呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a727a418e980013575f7c3bf03cedca012ffd4c2bd44008dbdcf49f7de2d05cd","ja":"む～……前の予定が押してて、事務所に\n寄れないんだって。さっき電話があったの。","zh":"唔～……说是前面的预定延时了，\n来不了事务所。刚才打过电话了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d8b4aa755688b05cd82d7b7c4942c6e5e308b9c21dd365c497be087af7c17fdc","ja":"迎えに行けないので、配信番組の収録に間に合うよう、\n時間までに皆で移動しておいて欲しいそうです。","zh":"因为无法前去接应，所以希望大家\n能在时间截止前自行前往，赶上网络直播节目的录制。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2d6aaa5199b7b154a82005e86ce6f9e299035125f00eff39dc5505773795974f","ja":"え～っ！　せっかくふたりいっぺんにイタズラする\nいいアイデア考えてきたのに～！","zh":"诶～！明明我都特地想好了\n能一口气对两个人恶作剧的好点子了说～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"24dc2ccfb7a48b6a4c704ed4bc48f88989bd548f16fac03dfce23e7fa116a881","ja":"……ところで、新人のふたりは一緒じゃないの？","zh":"……话说回来，那两位新人没有跟你在一起吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"96f21acb5545bebf42d5f81ab4034d0894b57a299036aab49e60c078a877fb55","ja":"あっ、ここにいるよ……。","zh":"啊，在这里哦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a79be446957806eef48c7d72f0f4f84e6896e228ce57458a27be739933f11be9","ja":"ふたりとも、なんでそんな隅っこにいんの？\nもっと真ん中で、ででーんってしてればいいのに。","zh":"你们两个，为什么待在那种角落里啊？\n明明再往中间站一点，堂堂正正地待着就好了嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"fc24800ced9482894f61bd4b244f2887d8ddd1b76421bb1a53192db10b1a9e89","ja":"その……今日は夜から番組だって思ったら、\n落ち着かなくって……。","zh":"那个……一想到今晚有节目，\n就静不下心来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"81611da706d3eec8d2be1abbdf96bc845f8f1b9f398819c52db549b856cdfd6d","ja":"みなさんのバックダンサーはステージで何度か\n経験したけど、生配信されるって考えたら……。","zh":"虽然在舞台上担任大家的伴舞已经有过好几次\n经验了，但一想到还要现场直播……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f45cfa5d2f187417730c30539969093087d238c8a8ffc203d0c3f9067b18fee9","ja":"しかたないな～……。","zh":"真拿你没办法～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1278.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"728f123b98d471fc9f228f497865002572808ac8062cb543272927d3e4ea11fd","ja":"ここは、真美に任せてちょ♪\nふたりがリラックスできるようにしてあげるかんね！","zh":"这里就交给真美吧♪\n真美会让你们两位放松下来的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
